@FlexibleNotification.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5282

### Send Email Notification
POST {{FlexibleNotification.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notification/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Email",
  "to": "user@example.com",
  "subject": "Welcome",
  "body": "Hello from Flexible Notification Service!"
}

### Send SMS Notification
POST {{FlexibleNotification.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notification/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Sms",
  "to": "+959123456789",
  "subject": "",
  "body": "Your OTP code is 123456"
}

### Send Firebase Notification
POST {{FlexibleNotification.Api_HostAddress}}/api/notification/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Firebase",
  "to": "device-fcm-token-xyz",
  "subject": "New Alert",
  "body": "You have a new message."
}

